### Register Organisation + Admin (one-time)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgName": "Rama Organisations",
  "adminName": "RamaDevi",
  "email": "admin@Ramadevi.com",
  "password": "Rama123",
  "isAdmin": true
}

###

### Admin Login
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@basant.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

###

### Employee Login
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ramakrishna@basant.com",
  "password": "123456789"
}

###

### Change Password (Employee – first login)
